From 9825dc72a402bf9d8613f6fbafcc9ffa87698ff7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Rabert <ar@nullsum.net>
Date: Fri, 20 Mar 2026 03:23:13 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] feat: add libplacebo swapchain render path for libmpv
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add MPV_RENDER_PARAM_VULKAN_SURFACE to pass a VkSurfaceKHR to mpv.
When provided, mpv's internal libplacebo creates a pl_swapchain on the
surface — handling format selection, Wayland color management, and
display profile negotiation identically to standalone mpv.

Add MPV_RENDER_PARAM_VULKAN_SWAPCHAIN_SIZE for dynamic resize and
MPV_RENDER_PARAM_DISPLAY_PROFILE for passing the host's queried
display HDR profile (scaled luminances) to the swapchain colorspace hint.

New pl_video_render_to_swapchain() uses the swapchain's color_space
as the rendering target instead of building it from options, giving
libplacebo the full display profile for correct tone mapping of both
HDR and SDR content.
